      <statement><p>If <m>A</m> and <m>B</m> are invertible <m>n\times n</m> matrices,
then the inverse of <m>A+B</m> is <m>A^{-1}+B^{-1}</m>.<ul form="popup" name="AnSwEr0001"><li>
